{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ab5baa5d2329a566f56d1c6afcb2a763d73552195e89ccf2e9d0cd548ef1ea36","ja":"でも、杏奈……すっごく、楽しかった……な。","zh":"不过，杏奈……觉得超级、开心的……呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"01b6d1cb49c1b2abf46511e15ae4d6c34e48ca77f570c76494456b03d6f85d9b","ja":"亜美も！　スタッフさんからも、「街の人も気軽に\n答えてくれていいロケだったよ」って言われたし～♪","zh":"亚美也是！工作人员也对我说：\n“街上的人都很乐意回答，是很棒的一次外景哦”～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"2043073256f499e1bdf7e7d945e4d30d601ab66f177615df9330e6a12ac8063b","ja":"次はどんな指示をだそうかな～。んっふっふ～♪","zh":"接下来要下达什么样的指示呢～？嗯哼哼～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9b85bb5adbd864230110339e0d0ece488fa76828172ea2a278067935f35cf8e3","ja":"えっ……！？　また……やるの？","zh":"诶……！？　还要……再来吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"9919105d13f5adceda7d275ae3ba188a4f477aea3167e4d2285193a572e41552","ja":"モチのロンっしょ！\n他のみんなもさそって、ドカーンってやっちゃおー！","zh":"那当然啦！\n把其他人也叫上，轰轰烈烈地大干一场吧——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1638.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d34a59bf2148d234e7f6845d4963375f8552b3442df19b3b70ff2efb5d5e4ede","ja":"ん……でも、どんどん過激に、なりそうだから……。\n杏奈、もう……いいかも……。","zh":"嗯……不过，感觉会变得越来越过激……\n杏奈觉得，还是……算了吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
